$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM tert-Butyl
2-(7-(4,4,5,5-Tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-2,3-dihydro-1H-pyrrolo[1,2-a]indol-1-ylidene)acetate:
To a solution of tert-butyl
2-(7-bromo-2,3-dihydro-1H-pyrrolo[1,2-a]indol-1-ylidene)acetate (300 mg,
0.86 mmol) and potassium acetate (296 mg, 3.02 mmol) in dioxane (10 mL)
was added 4,4,4',4',5,5,5',5'-octamethyl-2,2'-bi(1,3,2-dioxaborolane)
(241 mg, 0.95 mmol). Nitrogen was bubbled through the mixture for 10 min.
PdCl2(dppf) (31.5 mg, 0.04 mmol) was added and the mixture was stirred
under nitrogen at 90 °C for 1.5 h. The mixture was concentrated. The
residue was purified by silica gel flash chromatography to provide 0.34 g
(100%) of the title compound as a yellow solid. LCMS m/z = 396.3 [M+H]+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
