$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 3-(2,6-Dichloropyridin-4-yl)-1-(phenylsulfonyl)-1H-pyrrolo[2,3-b]pyridine
(19). A suspension of
1-(phenylsulfonyl)-3-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-pyrrolo[2,3-b]pyridine
(4.63 g, 12.1 mmol), 2,6-dichloro-4-iodopyridine (3.00 g, 11.0 mmol),
dichlorobis(triphenylphosphine)palladium(II) (0.308 g, 0.438 mmol) and
aqueous sodium carbonate (1M, 8.76 mL, 8.76 mmol) in DME/EtOH/water
(7:2:3) (30 mL) was degassed and heated at 80°C overnight. After cooling,
the suspension was diluted with EtOAc, filtered, washed with EtOAc and
water, and oven-dried to give 3.93 g of the desired product. The organic
layer of the filtrate was dried over MgSO4 and concentrated. The residue
was triturated with EtOAc/ether, filtered, washed with ether, and
oven-dried to give 0.515 g of the desired product.
3-(2,6-Dichloropyridin-4-yl)-1-(phenylsulfonyl)-1H-pyrrolo[2,3-b]pyridine
(19), yield 4.45 g, 100%. 1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO) δ 7.51-7.36 (m, 1H),
7.70-7.60 (m, 2H), 7.81-7.71 (m, 1H), 8.05 (s, 2H), 8.23-8.14 (m, 2H),
8.50-8.47 (m, 2H), 8.80 (s, 1H). MS (APCI) m/z 403.8 (M+H)+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM chemoselective, Suzuki coupling
