$DATUM 2,6-Bis(thiophen-2-yl)-4,4-dihexyl-4H-cyclopenta[2,1-b:3,4-b']dithiophene
(4). To a solution of 3 (0.689 g, 1.38 mmol) in dioxane/H2O (5/1, v/v, 20
mL) was added thiophen-2-ylboronic acid (0.425 g, 3.32 mmol), SPhos
(0.034 g, 0.08 mmol), K3PO4 (2.938 g, 13.84 mmol), and Pd(OAc)2 (0.012 g,
0.06 mmol) under argon. The reaction mixture was stirred for 4h under
room temperature. The crude product was extracted into dichloromethane,
and the organic layer was washed with water and dried over anhydrous
sodium sulfate. After removing solvent under reduced pressure, the
residue was purified by column chromatography (petroleum ether 60−90 °C)
on silica gel. An orange-yellow solid (0.700 g, 99% yield). 1H NMR (600
MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ: 7.48 (d, J=4.8 Hz, 2H), 7.32 (s, 2H), 7.30 (d, J=3.6
Hz, 2H), 7.09 (t, J=4.2 Hz, 2H), 1.89 (m, 4H), 1.13 (m, 12H), 0.89 (m,
4H), 0.77 (t, J=6.9 Hz, 6H). 13C NMR (150 MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ: 158.46,
137.34, 137.05, 134.33, 128.30, 124.74, 123.13, 118.52, 53.76, 36.85,
30.93, 28.92, 23.94, 21.98, 13.78. MS (ESI) m/z calcd. for (C29H34S4):
510.2. Found: 511.2 ([M+H]+). Anal. Calcd. for C29H34S4: C, 68.18; H,
6.71. Found: C, 68.27; H, 6.75.
