in Continuous Flow
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Noel, Timothy; Musacchio, Andrew J.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2011), 13(19), 5180-5183

